Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.67,0:02:01.60,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}夢みたいな日々に連日うなされ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.60,0:02:08.35,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}涙の数だけ強くはなれない
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.98,0:02:15.11,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}世界はいつも自分次第だ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.11,0:02:22.24,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}神様にさえもわからない道をゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.24,0:02:28.50,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}困難、迷わないなんて誰にでもできない
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.37,0:02:37.76,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}ああ、踏み出す足が君の導になる
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.38,0:02:44.15,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}一切合切無くなってしまっても
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.15,0:02:48.29,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}まだ君は君だという
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.27,0:02:52.54,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}何一つ消えないから
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.90,0:02:58.61,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}遠く離れてしまったとしても
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.03,0:03:02.37,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}振り向かず歩こう
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.94,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}明日は明日の風が吹く
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.29,0:03:11.00,OP_JP_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}誰にも追いつけない
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.67,0:02:01.60,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}被噩梦般的日子压得喘不过气
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.60,0:02:08.35,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}但是哭泣只会让人停滞不前
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.98,0:02:15.11,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}自己的世界  由自己做主
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.11,0:02:22.24,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}道路的前方  神明也不知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.24,0:02:28.50,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}身处困境  任谁都会迷茫
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.37,0:02:37.76,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}踏出的步伐  就是你前进的路标
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.38,0:02:44.15,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}就算失去一切
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.15,0:02:48.29,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}你还是那个你
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.27,0:02:52.54,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}在记忆中永不消逝
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.90,0:02:58.61,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}所以即便已经相隔两地
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.03,0:03:02.37,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}也要径直向前走
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.94,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}明天有着明天的风
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.29,0:03:11.00,OP_CH_FX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,500)\3c&HCC9598&\bord1}谁也追赶不上
